    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, people say it's not a big deal but it is. it's the only thing that made sense. now i just wake up and realize i'm still here and he isn't, and what's the point of that? it just feels like everything is built on this cycle of losing everything you love until you're just... left with nothing. it feels so futile.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
