      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your feeling that life has lost its meaning because you no longer have that foundation is a profound and valid pain that no one can minimize for you. It takes a heavy burden for a life to feel futile when a core part of you is missing, and trust that the void you feel is a natural, if painful, part of the healing process.",
